<title>UK: GOLF-WOOSNAM WINS BRITISH PGA TITLE.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WOOSNAM WINS BRITISH PGA TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ian Woosnam of Britain won the British PGA championship by two strokes on Monday with a two-under-par 70 in the final round for a 72-hole total of 275, 13 under par.</p>
</text>
